&lt;p&gt;You will lead the planning and execution of complex programs across this portfolio. You will partner with Core Technology leaders, architects, engineers, Product, Data, Security, IT, and other stakeholders to translate technical strategy into executable plans, coordinate cross-team dependencies and decisions, manage risks, and drive programs from discovery through implementation, adoption, and operational handoff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will report into the Director, Technical Program Management.&lt;/p&gt;
