&lt;p&gt;The base pay for this role is: &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;$117,576.00 &lt;/span&gt;- &lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;$154,318.50&lt;/span&gt; per year. You are also eligible for employee benefits, participation in Oscar&#39;s unlimited vacation program and annual performance bonuses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
