&lt;li&gt;Lead technical project teams and the end-to-end management of system implementations for a portfolio of Core Technology projects, such as cloud and platform migrations, identity services, observability capabilities, continuous-delivery and workflow platforms, developer and AI tooling, and data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze project risks, develop recommendations for risk mitigation and effectively communicate mitigation options to management and business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiently deploy the team’s technical toolkit to solve operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement and lead key process improvements that markedly move the organization towards operational excellence and develop solutions that radically improve the efficacy and efficiency of existing operational processes or unlock new capabilities through technology and automated solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships and trust with key stakeholders (such as Product, Engineering and Data Orgs) through strong partnership, clear communication, and the consistent, high-quality and timely delivery of projects.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Introduce tools, best practices and systems to support more efficient technical program management and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compliance with all applicable laws and regulations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Other duties as assigned.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of technical program or project management/process-oriented operations work experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience using using coding languages such as SQL to analyze project performance and risks and develop reports for management and business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree or 4 years commensurate experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP/Lean Six Sigma certification.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Metrics-driven program and project management approach, constantly guiding business partners towards ‘zero defects’.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a technical or system implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
